==German==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|goh|de}} {{m|goh|tolmetsche}}. Compare Proto-Slavic {{m|sla-pro|*tъlmačь||interpreter}} (Russian {{m|ru|sc=Cyrl|толмач|tr=tolmáč}}, Polish {{m|pl|tłumacz}}), whence borrowed from a {{etyl|trk|de}} language; compare Proto-Turkic {{m|trk-pro|*tilmaç}} (Turkish {{m|tr|dil}}, Azeri {{m|az|dil}}).

